cd[6]['evidence']='Main reader inspected crops 05 and 06. Both tall initials permit L/l; uncertainty is marked at each occurrence, not only the first. Crops: readers/018/C/crops/05.jpg; readers/018/C/crops/06.jpg.'
cd[15]['reading']=r'\unsure{Compositum|compositum} (singular) composita (plural) than composita, compositae ?'
